scn 1
# Two Spirit Wolves, one behind the other, ordered together onto an Aramon Lodestone (2x2): each
# walks to its own origin on Attack_Melee's rectangle round the footprint (404690 -> 4d4e80).
name melee-lode-together
ticks 900
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
wanderers off
map flat 120 100
type w fbi zonwolf
type lode fbi aralode
group W1 0 w 1 cells 40,30 weapons=on
group W2 0 w 1 cells 40,26 weapons=on
group L 1 lode 1 cells 40,60 weapons=off
reach R W1,W2 L marks=300,600
at 1 attack W1,W2 @L
